发起方 客户端 类型 request 方法名 cc.api.motion.cmd_vel 请求参数 <code>JSON&lt;br&gt;{&lt;br&gt;  "velocity":[x, y, yaw]&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;</code> 返回数据 <code>JSON&lt;br&gt;{&lt;br&gt;  "result": "accept"&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;或&lt;br&gt;{&lt;br&gt;  "result": "reject",&lt;br&gt;  "reason": "not in remote mode"&lt;br&gt;}&lt;br&gt;</code> <p>使用示例</p> <pre><code>ubt::robot::Api::Json js;
js["velocity"] = {0.3, 0.0, 0.0};
while (true) {
    ubt_api.request("cc.api.motion.cmd_vel", js,
      [](const ubt::robot::Api::Response&amp; rsp) {
        if (rsp.error.code == 0) {
          std::cout &lt;&lt; "cmd vel success, js_result = " &lt;&lt; rsp.js_result.dump() &lt;&lt; std::endl;
        } else {
          std::cout &lt;&lt; "cmd vel fail, code: " &lt;&lt; rsp.error.code
                    &lt;&lt; ", message: " &lt;&lt; rsp.error.message &lt;&lt; std::endl;
        }
      }
    );
    sleep(1);
}
</code></pre> <p>范围:</p> <p>x = [-0.3, 0.8]</p> <p>y = [-0.3, 0.3]</p> <p>yaw = [-0.6, 0.6]</p> <p>前提条件：通过原子技能A000004将腿部模式切为DYNAMIC后调用此接口</p> <p>停止：通过原子技能A000004将腿部模式切为STAND后停止行走和踏步</p> <p>规则：超过2s无指令，速度置零</p>
